# Design System Rules

Before generating or modifying UI:

1. Read [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md) at the repository root.
2. Import components from `@ssota/ui/components/ui/*` — do not duplicate shadcn components in apps.
3. Use semantic tokens only (`bg-background`, `text-primary`, `border-border`, etc.). Do not introduce raw hex or ad-hoc `neutral-*` / `green-*` palette classes.
4. **Base UI** primitives — use `render` prop for triggers/closes. Do **not** use Radix `asChild` patterns or copy Radix examples.
5. Select/Combobox: use Base UI `items` prop patterns from installed components.
6. New shadcn components: `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <name> -y -c apps/web` (installs to `packages/ui`).

Design Lab reference: `pnpm design-lab` → `apps/design-lab` (port 6007).
